      "problem": "Given that $w=⟨-1,0,3⟩$, find $|\\,w\\,|.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,w\\,| & =\\sqrt{{w}_{x}^{2}+{w}_{y}^{2}+{w}_{z}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+0+9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
